title: About this mirror
tags: Wiki

This is an ''unofficial, ad-free mirror'' of the [ext[Idle Skilling Fandom wiki|https://idle-skilling.fandom.com/wiki/Idle_Skilling_Wiki]], converted to TiddlyWiki. It is not affiliated with Fandom, the wiki's staff or the game's developer.

!! Licence and authors

The wiki's text is by its contributors and is licensed under [ext[Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0)|https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/]]. This mirror is a modified version and is released under the same licence. Every converted tiddler keeps a `source` field with its original page; the footer under each one links that page and its ''history'', which lists the authors.

!! What changed

* Converted from MediaWiki markup to TiddlyWiki markup by `scripts/wiki/to-tiddlywiki.ts` (in the idle-skilling-toolbox repo), from a dump of the wiki taken through its API.
* ''No images.'' Images from the wiki or the game are not included; where the wiki shows one, its file name (and caption) is kept as text in a dashed box, like <span class="mw-img">Pet Slime</span>.
* Tables that hold game things (monsters, cards, pets, potions, crops…) are rebuilt from the wiki's data as one tiddler per row, so they can be sorted and filtered; see [[Data and tools]].
* Fandom-only features (collapsible tables, tabs) became TiddlyWiki equivalents. Markup the converter could not express is shown as-is in a <span class="mw-raw">yellow box</span> rather than dropped.

The content is as of the dump date (2026-10-02); the live wiki may have changed since.
